WEBVTT

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:08.041
-<i>Good morning.</i>
-<i>Morning.</i>

00:00:13.166 --> 00:00:14.958
-Morning.
-Morning.

00:00:15.083 --> 00:00:16.000
JAEWON HIGH SCHOOL

00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:20.750
Dude,
I've been waiting forever.

00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:23.666
Sorry, I stayed up late
getting to a new tier.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.041
-Wait for me.
-Hey, over there.

00:00:26.208 --> 00:00:28.416
Come on, it's him. That guy, that guy.

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:30.166
Who? Oh.

00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:32.208
Lee Nam-su from Fashion class?

00:00:32.625 --> 00:00:34.208
What are those?

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:35.750
Awesome!

00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:38.333
It's impossible
to get those shoes these days.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.875
They're so dope.

00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:42.083
You know,
Lee Nam-su's family must be rich.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:45.916
<i>Would you look at that?</i>
<i>I guess they do have an eye for style.</i>

00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:48.375
What's with you?

00:00:48.833 --> 00:00:50.833
Um, Jin-seong.

00:00:51.291 --> 00:00:53.625
Wearing the same shoes as me again.

00:00:54.291 --> 00:00:57.791
-Jeez, it's too early to be this annoyed.
-Oh. Right, sorry.

00:00:58.083 --> 00:00:59.416
I forgot.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.041
Exactly the same brand of shoe.

00:01:01.125 --> 00:01:04.666
-Oh. Uh, mine are a size smaller.
-What'd you say, idiot?

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:06.708
-Huh?
-Want me to make you a size smaller?

00:01:06.791 --> 00:01:08.916
-Look at little Nam-su talking back.
-Huh?

00:01:09.041 --> 00:01:11.625
He's just itching
to get a shoe stuck in his mouth.

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:14.041
We look like a couple, I can't have that.

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:16.000
What do you think you're doing?

00:01:16.125 --> 00:01:19.000
I'm… so sorry. I'm really sorry.

00:01:20.125 --> 00:01:21.583
Forget it.

00:01:22.083 --> 00:01:23.583
Who cares if <i>he's</i> wearing them?

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:26.166
-Hmm?
-Hmm? Hmm.

00:01:27.125 --> 00:01:29.625
Jin-seong's been so nice lately.

00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:31.500
He could go on that show…

00:01:31.625 --> 00:01:33.750
<i>…Believe It or Don't.</i>

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:35.750
Our Jin-seong has changed.

00:01:40.875 --> 00:01:42.416
I'm just kidding, I'm kidding.

00:01:42.583 --> 00:01:47.000
I hate those guys.
But it's okay.

00:01:47.833 --> 00:01:51.291
I've got a secret weapon I picked up
from an out-of-town flea market.

00:03:34.625 --> 00:03:36.333
-Hmm?
-Huh?

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.750
Whoa, amazing.

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:48.791
<i>Yeah.</i>
<i>Nothing can steal my thunder.</i>

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:53.125
Oh, wow, aren't those from Chrome Heart's
new line?

00:03:54.875 --> 00:03:56.416
<i>What the heck?</i>

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.708
<i>All five of his fingers</i>
<i>are dripping with Chrome Heart's rings.</i>

00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:01.541
-What do you think these rings cost him?
-Oh.

00:04:01.625 --> 00:04:03.083
Whoa, he is the king of hip.

00:04:03.208 --> 00:04:04.500
-Oh.
-Wow. Gorgeous.

00:04:04.625 --> 00:04:08.375
Huh. They're all limited edition,
you have to pay a premium for them.

00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:11.625
-Even I don't have that one.
-You have no idea.

00:04:11.791 --> 00:04:12.708
-Huh?
-Hmm?

00:04:12.958 --> 00:04:16.000
His watch
is a limited edition Hublot.

00:04:16.166 --> 00:04:18.125
It costs two hundred million won.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:20.916
It got famous when the popstar DG wore it.

00:04:21.291 --> 00:04:24.083
Jae-yeol,
where did you get all those things?

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:29.208
Um…

00:04:30.666 --> 00:04:32.708
Have you ever seen him respond?

00:04:34.041 --> 00:04:34.958
Um…

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:36.750
Hey, Jae-yeol.

00:04:37.625 --> 00:04:41.083
He always seems so good
at picking all the best brands.

00:04:41.541 --> 00:04:43.666
He's plastered from head
to toe with brands

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.666
so expensive that no one can afford them.

00:04:45.916 --> 00:04:49.958
He's good-looking
and has a good reputation. Too bad.

00:04:50.833 --> 00:04:53.541
He's so quiet
that he never makes his presence known.

00:04:53.958 --> 00:04:56.666
It's such
a cryin' shame.

00:04:57.916 --> 00:05:00.833
There he is.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.083
Oh,
he looks so great today too.

00:05:03.666 --> 00:05:05.375
-Hi, Hyeong-seok.
-Oh, hi.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:07.250
He looks like a real prince.

00:05:07.666 --> 00:05:09.583
Hyeong-seok,
what are you doing after school?

00:05:09.666 --> 00:05:11.250
We're going to D-Cube today.

00:05:11.333 --> 00:05:12.625
-Huh? Ji-ho.
-What?

00:05:13.916 --> 00:05:16.250
-Hi, there.
-Uh, hi.

00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:18.541
Hyeong-seok is so friendly to people.

00:05:18.666 --> 00:05:20.916
-Huh?
-By the way, do you have a girlfriend?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.833
Got weekend plans, huh?

00:05:25.333 --> 00:05:27.000
Dark horse rising in rank.

00:05:27.083 --> 00:05:29.166
He beat Jin-seong
right after he transferred here.

00:05:29.375 --> 00:05:32.750
Hmm. They don't seem to know much
considering they're in the Fashion class.

00:05:32.875 --> 00:05:34.375
That's what I'm saying.

00:05:35.833 --> 00:05:37.791
Look, his face and proportions

00:05:37.875 --> 00:05:40.125
have everyone else
in the class distracted,

00:05:40.541 --> 00:05:43.041
but he's always wearing the same shoes.

00:05:43.125 --> 00:05:45.125
And he carries a ratty backpack.

00:05:45.458 --> 00:05:47.958
Park Hyeong-seok is a terrible dresser.

00:05:48.291 --> 00:05:49.791
He's completely broke.

00:06:05.083 --> 00:06:06.708
Is it true that Basco lost?

00:06:08.583 --> 00:06:12.750
-What? He lost a one-on-one fight?
-He's not coming to school either.

00:06:12.875 --> 00:06:14.000
Is he feeling okay?

00:06:14.083 --> 00:06:16.541
Park Beom-jae,
just say something already.

00:06:17.625 --> 00:06:21.041
<i>Where are you</i>
<i>and what are you doing, Basco?</i>

00:06:21.625 --> 00:06:24.291
It's Basco!

00:06:25.666 --> 00:06:27.708
-He sent a message.
-What's he saying?

00:06:27.791 --> 00:06:30.000
<i>Bam-jae ny svreen is btoken.</i>

00:06:30.083 --> 00:06:32.166
<i>I eant ti gix it, bit when I gry to gype,</i>

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:35.000
<i>gee sgattered svreen vut nye fingers</i>
<i>and it nakes ne vleef.</i>

00:06:35.083 --> 00:06:37.625
<i>I van't dee gee svreen</i>
<i>becaude og gee vloof.</i>

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.291
<i>Oh, why doesn't he just call me?</i>

00:06:39.375 --> 00:06:40.791
ABIOSHIEJX GAKEHEHGIE BNUAPEHFFI

00:06:40.916 --> 00:06:43.750
<i>He's trying to type when</i>
<i>he can't see, of course, it's not working.</i>

00:06:43.833 --> 00:06:45.333
What is it? Is Basco okay?

00:06:45.416 --> 00:06:47.250
Uh, yeah.
I… I think he is.

00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:49.750
Oh, he scared me.

00:06:49.916 --> 00:06:51.750
-What a relief.
-When's he coming?

00:06:51.916 --> 00:06:53.791
-Making us worry, geez.
-So, what is he saying?

00:06:53.916 --> 00:06:55.541
EGHIPHAENIG FALHEIGHIO
FAHIGHE GHIAEHG

00:06:55.625 --> 00:06:58.250
Oh, um, uh…

00:07:04.375 --> 00:07:06.291
"The new student
hasn't told others about the fight."

00:07:06.458 --> 00:07:08.333
"I haven't figured out
what his plan is yet."

00:07:08.625 --> 00:07:10.916
"So lie low and wait for me."

00:07:11.583 --> 00:07:13.416
Yeah! That's our Basco.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.916
Great. Let's keep an eye
on the situation for now like he says.

00:07:16.041 --> 00:07:17.791
-Yeah!
-Basco!

00:07:22.208 --> 00:07:23.583
He's so good-looking.

00:07:23.666 --> 00:07:25.875
And so handsome.

00:07:26.041 --> 00:07:27.958
I hope they serve sausage tomorrow.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:32.291
It's the Vocal class students.

00:07:34.583 --> 00:07:36.416
Hey, the next class.

00:07:36.708 --> 00:07:38.875
-Oh, yeah. PE.
-Look at his face.

00:07:39.083 --> 00:07:42.083
Shall I get your PE uniform
ready for you?

00:07:42.208 --> 00:07:44.083
Get to it then, you fat ass.

00:07:45.541 --> 00:07:47.416
-Oh!
-Oh, yikes.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.833
Why did he do that?

00:07:50.166 --> 00:07:51.708
No wonder he's the class pariah.

00:07:51.791 --> 00:07:53.750
He looks like a pig.

00:07:53.875 --> 00:07:56.083
-I mean, don't you think?
-What? What is it?

00:07:59.041 --> 00:08:00.458
-Huh?
-Huh? What?

00:08:00.583 --> 00:08:02.625
Aren't you the new student…

00:08:02.708 --> 00:08:04.208
…from Fashion Class?

00:08:04.291 --> 00:08:06.291
-Is he gonna be okay?
-Got something to say?

00:08:06.375 --> 00:08:08.791
-Shouldn't we stop him?
-Whoa, this is big.

00:08:08.875 --> 00:08:09.916
Take a video.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.041
The air
he's putting on is so over the top,

00:08:12.125 --> 00:08:14.500
but what's even more over the top
is how handsome Park Hyeong-seok is.

00:08:14.625 --> 00:08:16.583
Hyeong-seok will probably win.

00:08:16.666 --> 00:08:18.583
He beat Jin-seong.

00:08:19.041 --> 00:08:20.833
Hey! Boys, what are you doing?

00:08:20.916 --> 00:08:22.416
-Huh?
-Oh, it's the teacher.

00:08:22.541 --> 00:08:24.500
-Uh-oh.
-Hey, let's go.

00:08:25.375 --> 00:08:28.791
-You're fucking nothing.
-Consider this your lucky day.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.166
-What's going on?
-Oh, no.

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:36.375
-You okay?
-Huh?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.458
Oh.

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:55.625
In the late '60s, the hippie culture
brought on a big change,

00:08:55.708 --> 00:08:58.416
especially to the way
the younger generation dressed.

00:08:58.791 --> 00:09:03.458
In the U.S., the folk singers' styles
expressed anti-war sentiments

00:09:03.625 --> 00:09:05.541
opposing the war in Vietnam,

00:09:05.708 --> 00:09:07.791
and the style of wearing
a t-shirt and jeans

00:09:07.875 --> 00:09:10.750
started to leave an impression
on the younger generations.

00:09:18.083 --> 00:09:19.500
Let's go to the internet cafe.

00:09:19.583 --> 00:09:21.291
I can't. I didn't bring my wallet.

00:09:21.375 --> 00:09:24.041
-You never have it.
-I'm gonna go to Han-seong's.

00:09:24.166 --> 00:09:26.208
But you said
you'd go with me to D-Cube.

00:09:26.333 --> 00:09:29.291
Huh?

00:09:29.791 --> 00:09:31.833
Uh, Mom?

00:09:32.541 --> 00:09:34.916
Yeah, school just ended. Huh?

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.291
My voice sounds weird?

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:41.208
Oh!
I, uh, I-- I think I'm getting a cold.

00:09:41.458 --> 00:09:44.375
No I'm fine. I'm fine.
It… it's really nothing.

00:09:45.583 --> 00:09:46.750
Huh? Tomorrow?

00:09:47.166 --> 00:09:51.166
Oh. Oh, my birthday is tomorrow.
Uh, I forgot about that.

00:09:52.916 --> 00:09:54.958
I have work tomorrow
so you don't have to come.

00:09:55.375 --> 00:09:56.750
No, it's fine really.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.875
24+ CONVENIENCE STORE

00:09:59.958 --> 00:10:04.708
<i>Hmm. My voice changes</i>
<i>when I'm in the grown-up handsome body.</i>

00:10:07.083 --> 00:10:07.958
<i>Hmm.</i>

00:10:08.875 --> 00:10:11.791
<i>I should really be careful,</i>
<i>especially on the phone.</i>

00:10:11.916 --> 00:10:16.666
-Hmm? Oh, hello. Welcome. Th…
-Hello, there.

00:10:23.791 --> 00:10:25.375
<i>She's so pretty.</i>

00:10:27.458 --> 00:10:33.000
-Are you still working out these days?
-Oh, um, yeah, I'm still doing the thing.

00:10:33.125 --> 00:10:35.750
Keep up the hard work.

00:10:39.333 --> 00:10:40.208
Okay.

00:10:41.666 --> 00:10:43.291
<i>Why are you being nice to us?</i>

00:10:43.458 --> 00:10:44.333
Huh?

00:10:45.083 --> 00:10:47.291
We're just not popular like you.

00:10:48.291 --> 00:10:49.958
-Oh.
-It's just a bit weird

00:10:50.125 --> 00:10:53.333
that you asked both of us here
to have lunch with you.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.166
What's with Hyeong-seok today?

00:10:55.291 --> 00:10:56.791
Has he gotten even hotter somehow?

00:10:56.875 --> 00:11:00.250
-But why's he with those losers?
-Did they do something wrong?

00:11:00.958 --> 00:11:04.958
-We're not like you.
-We? What we? Don't group us together.

00:11:07.291 --> 00:11:10.333
Hmm? Why is Hyeong-seok sitting
with those guys?

00:11:10.875 --> 00:11:13.833
He's hanging with Park Ji-ho,
he's our errand boy.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.500
-Jin-seong, you gonna let this slide?
-Huh?

00:11:16.708 --> 00:11:20.291
Hey, we said we'd be friends
after we drank together that time?

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:21.583
Be consistent.

00:11:22.333 --> 00:11:25.375
I'm not gonna bully kids,
it's not cool anymore, you know.

00:11:27.041 --> 00:11:29.125
I thought you were drunk,
but you remember everything.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.083
Hmm.

00:11:32.833 --> 00:11:35.583
Sorry. Do you not want to eat with me?

00:11:35.916 --> 00:11:37.375
-Hmm?
-No, it isn't that.

00:11:37.708 --> 00:11:39.250
I'm just curious as to why.

00:11:39.666 --> 00:11:42.416
I just… I just wanna be friends.

00:11:43.125 --> 00:11:45.166
Why with someone like me?

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:46.666
I don't know.

00:11:46.958 --> 00:11:50.208
I want the two of you
to get along together.

00:11:50.541 --> 00:11:52.916
Please, he needs that.

00:11:54.458 --> 00:11:55.916
Because you're like me.

00:11:57.125 --> 00:12:01.083
That's why.
I want to be friends with you.

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:04.208
Uh, I am like you?

00:12:05.833 --> 00:12:10.291
How on Earth am I like you?
I'm not handsome like you and my…

00:12:12.166 --> 00:12:14.625
-my family's poor.
-Mine is too.

00:12:17.416 --> 00:12:18.583
I'll get us some water.

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:22.541
Friends? Someone like him with us?

00:12:22.791 --> 00:12:26.666
-Isn't that a bit suspicious?
-Hey, I told you not to group us together.

00:12:29.916 --> 00:12:34.208
He's nothing but a broke pauper.
And those shoes look really cheap.

00:12:34.375 --> 00:12:37.083
-He doesn't even have a watch.
-Arrogant bastard.

00:12:37.541 --> 00:12:39.791
Let's knock him down a peg
in front of everyone.

00:12:56.375 --> 00:12:59.916
Only four came?
From the whole gang?

00:13:00.375 --> 00:13:01.541
This is all we could get?

00:13:03.458 --> 00:13:06.000
We're the only ones that have the guts
to attack the new student?

00:13:06.583 --> 00:13:09.083
Basco said to lay low,
so they're all not coming.

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:13.541
I told you that was not Basco's orders.
"Lie low and wait for me."

00:13:13.625 --> 00:13:16.250
There's no way
Basco would talk like that.

00:13:16.875 --> 00:13:19.291
Beom-jae, he made all that stuff up.

00:13:19.833 --> 00:13:23.291
We don't need to listen to him.
Does he think the Burn Knuckle is his?

00:13:23.416 --> 00:13:25.750
You know, Beom-jae won't be able
to act so bossy

00:13:25.833 --> 00:13:27.125
if we go beat up that new kid.

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.166
That's right.

00:13:29.708 --> 00:13:32.041
Why don't we go teach
him a lesson?

00:13:45.291 --> 00:13:48.833
Oh. Huh? Jae-yeol.

00:13:50.875 --> 00:13:52.125
Is your house this way too?

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:55.625
Huh?

00:13:55.833 --> 00:13:57.250
HAPPY BIRTHDAY

00:13:57.666 --> 00:13:59.166
How did you know today was my birthday?

00:14:01.708 --> 00:14:02.791
Can I open it?

00:14:06.375 --> 00:14:08.750
This is…

00:14:11.708 --> 00:14:13.583
Oh, thank you. I appreciate it.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:18.291
But I can't…
I can't take all of these from you.

00:14:19.958 --> 00:14:21.208
You were gonna throw them out anyway,

00:14:21.291 --> 00:14:23.000
So that's what I should do
if I don't like them?

00:14:25.708 --> 00:14:27.916
Okay, then.

00:14:28.791 --> 00:14:31.750
Thank you. I'll use them.

00:14:32.583 --> 00:14:35.500
I just realized
this is the first birthday I'm on my own.

00:14:36.125 --> 00:14:38.916
And the first time I've gotten a present
from someone other than my mom.

00:14:39.083 --> 00:14:42.416
Jae-yeol, when's your birthda--

00:14:43.125 --> 00:14:44.250
Uh…

00:14:45.625 --> 00:14:46.541
Huh?

00:14:48.333 --> 00:14:50.583
Ah. So much fashion.

00:14:59.833 --> 00:15:01.875
What is it with that…

00:15:03.416 --> 00:15:05.166
blonde-haired bastard?

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.583
<i>Hi, Mom.</i>

00:15:11.875 --> 00:15:14.041
Yeah, of course,
I had fun with my friends.

00:15:14.166 --> 00:15:15.791
I got a lot of presents too.

00:15:16.791 --> 00:15:18.875
Yeah, I… I gotta get to work soon.

00:15:21.833 --> 00:15:23.250
Yeah, you too.

00:15:23.541 --> 00:15:25.541
Huh? And what's this?

00:15:27.375 --> 00:15:31.166
I've never seen anything like these.
Jae-yeol's such a nice guy.

00:15:32.041 --> 00:15:34.750
He was gonna throw all this out,
so it's okay.

00:15:36.125 --> 00:15:40.291
Hmm. Oh. I don't think the rings
will fit this finger.

00:15:43.708 --> 00:15:47.541
It sure is nice to be you.

00:16:04.333 --> 00:16:05.458
LEADERS OF THE FUTURE

00:16:05.541 --> 00:16:07.666
Yun-gi's set a new record
for being handsome.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:10.083
-Seriously?
-I know it's fucking crazy.

00:16:10.166 --> 00:16:12.291
-That's my husband.
-What do you mean he's your husband?

00:16:12.375 --> 00:16:14.125
-He's mine!
-Remember the plan.

00:16:14.583 --> 00:16:17.875
When Park Hyeong-seok comes in,
the girls will all start to swarm him.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.916
Then we ask him
what brand his clothes are.

00:16:20.166 --> 00:16:22.083
And he'll be completely embarrassed.

00:16:22.416 --> 00:16:25.583
Hyeong-seok, there he is!

00:16:25.958 --> 00:16:27.916
He's finally here.

00:16:28.833 --> 00:16:30.833
Oh, hi.

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:37.250
Hyeong-seok,
he looks more charming every day.

00:16:37.375 --> 00:16:39.333
-I know.
-You know, I dreamed of you yesterday.

00:16:39.458 --> 00:16:41.333
Are you freaking kidding me?

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:43.416
Are you the one
who followed us on our date?

00:16:44.833 --> 00:16:47.458
That's…
this season's coat from Balmain.

00:16:47.916 --> 00:16:49.875
Givenchy Rottweiler backpack.

00:16:50.541 --> 00:16:53.791
Valentino 19-FW
Rockstud Camo sneakers.

00:16:54.333 --> 00:16:57.250
He's wearing all luxury brands.

00:16:57.666 --> 00:17:00.500
Hyeong-seok, you look really good
in those clothes.

00:17:00.666 --> 00:17:02.291
-Oh, thank you.
-Did you buy them?

00:17:02.416 --> 00:17:04.541
-Oh, it was a gift.
-Who was it?

00:17:23.458 --> 00:17:25.375
TO NEW KID

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.958
I HAPPENED TO LEARN IT'S YOUR BIRTHDAY,
DON'T READ INTO IT.

00:17:28.041 --> 00:17:29.458
<i>Hmm? Hyeong-seok!</i>

00:17:29.875 --> 00:17:31.583
Who gave them to you?

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.541
Um, well…

00:17:37.041 --> 00:17:39.625
I got it from a friend.

00:17:54.958 --> 00:17:57.958
LKS ENTERTAINMENT
AUDITION WAITING ROOM

00:18:08.541 --> 00:18:10.541
