-Oh, yeah.

00:18:11.583 --> 00:18:14.000
Everything I experience
or that happens to me,

00:18:14.125 --> 00:18:15.833
the people I meet, it all inspires me.

00:18:16.375 --> 00:18:19.000
Ugh, quit spewing bullshit, you poser.

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:21.416
Number 16 to 20, come on in.

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.666
I'd be beating you up right now
if we weren't at an audition.

00:18:28.125 --> 00:18:31.166
YOUR SMILES ARE LIES
I HATE YOUR SMILE

00:18:36.583 --> 00:18:38.791
Hmm. These lyrics aren't bad.
